---
// Three modes inside the existing playground; Python bridge stays on loopback.
// Contract: docs/factory/specialist-labs.md.
---

<section
  id="specialists"
  class="specialist-labs"
  aria-labelledby="specialist-title"
>
  <div class="sp-heading">
    <div>
      <span class="sp-eyebrow">Mac-local specialist lab</span><h2
        id="specialist-title"
      >
        Three ways to teach a small model.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <span id="sp-connection" class="sp-state">Runtime disconnected</span>
  </div>
  <p class="sp-intro">
    Choose an answer, forecast a series, or predict a terminal screen. One
    workspace for inputs, training, evaluation, and saved models.
  </p>
  <details id="sp-connect-help" class="sp-connect-help" open>
    <summary>Start your local runtime</summary>
    <p>
      The specialist modes run on your Mac through Python. Your inputs stay
      between this page and the local runtime.
    </p>
    <pre><code>uv sync --project scripts/specialists --all-extras --frozen
pnpm --dir browser run build
uv run --project scripts/specialists python scripts/specialists/lab.py serve</code></pre>
    <div class="sp-connect-actions">
      <a href="http://127.0.0.1:8765/playground#specialists">Open local lab ↗</a
      ><button id="sp-connect" type="button">Connect runtime</button><a
        href="/docs/factory/specialist-labs">Setup, models &amp; commands</a
      >
    </div>
    <p class="sp-note">
      Download the selected model first using the setup commands. The runtime
      loads cached weights. Training defaults to one step; a training smoke
      proves wiring, not model quality.
    </p>
  </details>
  <div class="sp-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Specialist mode">
    <button
      id="sp-tab-decision"
      type="button"
      role="tab"
      aria-selected="true"
      aria-controls="sp-workspace"
      data-sp-mode="decision">01 <span>Decision</span></button
    >
    <button
      id="sp-tab-forecast"
      type="button"
      role="tab"
      aria-selected="false"
      aria-controls="sp-workspace"
      tabindex="-1"
      data-sp-mode="forecast">02 <span>Forecast</span></button
    >
    <button
      id="sp-tab-terminal"
      type="button"
      role="tab"
      aria-selected="false"
      aria-controls="sp-workspace"
      tabindex="-1"
      data-sp-mode="terminal">03 <span>Terminal world</span></button
    >
  </div>
  <div id="sp-workspace" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="sp-tab-decision">
    <div class="sp-mode-heading">
      <div>
        <h3 id="sp-mode-title">Make a choice in one forward pass.</h3><p
          id="sp-mode-description"
        >
          Compare every allowed answer. Fit temperature on separate examples
          before interpreting the probabilities.
        </p>
      </div><span id="sp-model" class="sp-model">Qwen3 · 1.7B · local</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sp-model-picker">
      <div>
        <label for="sp-model-select">Base model</label><select
          id="sp-model-select"
          disabled><option>Connect your local runtime</option></select
        >
      </div>
      <button id="sp-model-download" type="button" class="sp-secondary" disabled
        >Download selected model</button
      >
      <p id="sp-model-ready" class="sp-note" role="status">
        Pinned model choices and cached weights appear after connecting.
      </p>
    </div>
    <details class="sp-data-import" id="sp-import-panel">
      <summary>Bring your own data · CSV, JSON or JSONL</summary>
      <p class="sp-note">
        Preview your data, map its columns, and freeze separate training and
        evaluation windows. Files stay in the local lab.
      </p>
      <label for="sp-data-file"
        >Dataset<input
          id="sp-data-file"
          type="file"
          accept=".csv,.json,.jsonl"
          disabled
        /></label
      >
      <div id="sp-data-mapping" hidden>
        <div class="sp-mapping-grid">
          <label data-sp-map="decision" for="sp-map-question"
            >Question column<select id="sp-map-question"></select></label
          >
          <label data-sp-map="decision" for="sp-map-answer"
            >Answer column<select id="sp-map-answer"></select></label
          >
          <label data-sp-map="decision" for="sp-map-options"
            >Option columns · select two or more<select
              id="sp-map-options"
              multiple
              size="4"></select></label
          >
          <label data-sp-map="forecast" for="sp-map-time"
            >Timestamp column<select id="sp-map-time"></select></label
          >
          <label data-sp-map="forecast" for="sp-map-values"
            >Numeric target columns<select id="sp-map-values" multiple size="4"
            ></select></label
          >
          <label data-sp-map="forecast" for="sp-horizon"
            >Forecast horizon<input
              id="sp-horizon"
              type="number"
              min="1"
              max="32"
              value="8"
            /></label
          >
        </div>
        <div
          id="sp-data-preview"
          role="region"
          aria-label="Dataset preview"
          tabindex="0"
        >
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="sp-data-apply"
          >Validate &amp; use dataset</button
        >
      </div>
    </details>
    <p id="sp-data-summary" class="sp-note" role="status">
      Decision imports need at least 20 distinct labelled questions. Forecast
      data stays chronological. Terminal imports use recorded episode JSON.
    </p>
    <div class="sp-grid">
      <form id="sp-form">
        <label for="sp-action">Operation</label>
        <select id="sp-action"></select>
        <label id="sp-steps-label" for="sp-steps" hidden
          >Training steps · 1–200<input
            id="sp-steps"
            type="number"
            value="1"
            min="1"
            max="200"
          /></label
        >
        <p id="sp-ceiling-note" class="sp-note" hidden>
          Validate benchmark with Codex sends the held-out questions and choices
          to your signed-in Codex CLI. Gold labels stay local. No paid API is
          used.
        </p>
        <details id="sp-advanced">
          <summary>Advanced input JSON</summary>
          <div class="sp-input-heading">
            <label for="sp-input">Input JSON</label><label
              class="sp-file-label"
              for="sp-file"
              >Import JSON<input
                type="file"
                id="sp-file"
                accept=".json,.jsonl,application/json"
              /></label
            >
          </div>
          <textarea
            id="sp-input"
            spellcheck="false"
            aria-describedby="sp-input-help"
            rows="16"></textarea>
          <p id="sp-input-help" class="sp-note">
            Edit the example or import your input. No silent prompt truncation.
          </p>
        </details>
        <div class="sp-run-actions">
          <button id="sp-run" type="submit" disabled>Run locally →</button
          ><button id="sp-example" class="sp-secondary" type="button"
            >Reset example</button
          >
        </div>
      </form>
      <div class="sp-result-panel">
        <div class="sp-result-heading">
          <h4>Result</h4><span class="sp-quality">Unqualified model</span>
        </div>
        <p id="sp-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">
          Connect your local runtime to run this example.
        </p>
        <div id="sp-job-progress" hidden>
          <progress id="sp-progress" aria-label="Run progress" max="1"
          ></progress>
          <p id="sp-progress-text" class="sp-note" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <div id="sp-loss-chart"></div>
          <button type="button" id="sp-cancel" class="sp-secondary"
            >Cancel run</button
          >
        </div>
        <div id="sp-report" hidden></div>
        <div id="sp-visual"></div>
        <div id="sp-terminal-controls" hidden>
          <label for="sp-terminal-input">Type into the learned terminal</label>
          <input
            id="sp-terminal-input"
            type="text"
            autocomplete="off"
            autocapitalize="off"
            spellcheck="false"
            placeholder="Type a key or paste text"
          />
          <div class="sp-key-actions">
            <button type="button" data-sp-key="enter">Enter ↵</button><button
              type="button"
              data-sp-key="backspace">⌫</button
            ><button type="button" data-sp-key="escape">Esc</button><button
              type="button"
              data-sp-key="wait">Wait 1s</button
            ><button type="button" id="sp-reset-session">Reset session</button>
          </div>
          <p class="sp-note">
            Every frame is predicted. No shell runs here. A tiny typing artifact
            does not know shell commands.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="sp-output-actions">
          <button id="sp-export" type="button" class="sp-secondary" disabled
            >Export result</button
          ><button id="sp-use-artifact" type="button" hidden
            >Use trained artifact</button
          >
        </div>
        <details id="sp-inspector" hidden>
          <summary>Inspect full output</summary><pre id="sp-output"></pre>
        </details>
        <p id="sp-measurements" class="sp-note"></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sp-history">
      <div class="sp-result-heading">
        <h3>Saved runs</h3><button
          id="sp-refresh-runs"
          type="button"
          class="sp-secondary">Refresh runs</button
        >
      </div>
      <p class="sp-note">
        Configs, checkpoints and reports stay on your Mac. Reopen a completed
        run after restarting; cancelled runs remain in history.
      </p>
      <div id="sp-history" aria-live="polite">
        Connect your local runtime to see saved runs.
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="sp-boundary">
      These modes use a local Python runtime. Browser-only WASM/WebGPU execution
      for these specialists has not been built. The byte-level trainer above
      continues to run entirely in your tab.
    </p>
    <div class="sp-credits">
      Methods and upstream work: <a
        href="https://nishtahir.com/build-your-own-decision-model/"
        >Nish Tahir’s decision models</a
      > · <a href="https://mistral.ai/news/timestral/">Mistral Timestral</a> · <a
        href="https://simedw.com/2026/10/21/world-model-terminal/"
        >Simon Edwardsson’s WorldTUI</a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { setupSpecialistLabs } from "../specialists/labs";
  setupSpecialistLabs();
</script>

<style>
  .specialist-labs [hidden] {
    display: none !important;
  }
  .specialist-labs {
    max-width: 1160px;
    margin: 0 auto 80px;
    padding: 40px 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid #2c2f35;
    color: #e7e8ea;
    scroll-margin-top: 80px;
    font-family: "Geist Variable", sans-serif;
  }
  .sp-heading,
  .sp-mode-heading,
  .sp-input-heading,
  .sp-result-heading,
  .sp-connect-actions,
  .sp-run-actions,
  .sp-output-actions,
  .sp-key-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .sp-eyebrow {
    color: #48e5c2;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font:
      11px "Geist Mono Variable",
      monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 12px 0;
    font:
      500 clamp(25px, 3.2vw, 38px)/1.15 "Bricolage Grotesque Variable",
      sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }
  .sp-intro {
    max-width: 68ch;
    color: #a6adb9;
    margin: 10px 0 26px;
  }
  .sp-state,
  .sp-model,
  .sp-quality {
    font:
      11px "Geist Mono Variable",
      monospace;
    color: #a6adb9;
    border: 1px solid #2c2f35;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 5px;
  }
  .sp-connect-help {
    background: #111419;
    border: 1px solid #2c2f35;
    border-radius: 9px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
  }
  .sp-model-picker,
  .sp-data-import,
  .sp-history {
    margin: 20px 0;
    padding: 18px;
    border: 1px solid #2c2f35;
    border-radius: 9px;
  }
  .sp-model-picker {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .sp-model-picker > div {
    flex: 1 1 260px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .sp-model-picker select {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .sp-model-picker p {
    flex-basis: 100%;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .sp-mapping-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  #sp-data-preview {
    max-height: 200px;
    overflow: auto;
    margin: 16px 0;
    background: #090b0e;
    border-radius: 5px;
  }
  #sp-data-preview :global(table) {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  #sp-data-preview :global(th),
  #sp-data-preview :global(td) {
    padding: 9px 12px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2c2f35;
    max-width: 320px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  input[type="number"] {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 10px;
    background: #111419;
    border: 1px solid #2c2f35;
    color: #e7e8ea;
    border-radius: 7px;
  }
  #sp-advanced {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  #sp-advanced summary {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    color: #a6adb9;
  }
  progress {
    width: 100%;
    accent-color: #48e5c2;
  }
  #sp-loss-chart :global(svg) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 120px;
  }
  #sp-history :global(article) {
    border-top: 1px solid #2c2f35;
    padding: 14px 0;
  }
  #sp-history :global(p) {
    color: #a6adb9;
    font-size: 12px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  #sp-history :global(button),
  #sp-report :global(a) {
    margin: 4px 8px 4px 0;
  }
  #sp-history :global(button) {
    background: transparent;
    border-color: #2c2f35;
    color: #a6adb9;
  }
  #sp-report :global(table) {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  #sp-report :global(th),
  #sp-report :global(td) {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 10px 5px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2c2f35;
  }
  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .sp-connect-help p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #a6adb9;
  }
  pre {
    max-width: 100%;
    overflow: auto;
    background: #090b0e;
    padding: 14px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font:
      11px/1.8 "Geist Mono Variable",
      monospace;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  a {
    color: #48e5c2;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .sp-connect-actions {
    justify-content: flex-start;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .sp-tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2c2f35;
    margin-top: 26px;
  }
  .sp-tabs button {
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-radius: 0;
    color: #787d88;
    font:
      11px "Geist Mono Variable",
      monospace;
  }
  .sp-tabs button span {
    margin-left: 8px;
    font:
      14px "Geist Variable",
      sans-serif;
  }
  .sp-tabs button[aria-selected="true"] {
    color: #48e5c2;
    border-bottom-color: #48e5c2;
  }
  .sp-mode-heading {
    margin: 26px 0;
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .sp-mode-heading p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 65ch;
    color: #9296a0;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .sp-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
  }
  form,
  .sp-result-panel {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #a6adb9;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  select,
  textarea,
  input[type="text"] {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid #2c2f35;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: #111419;
    color: #e7e8ea;
    padding: 12px;
    font:
      12px/1.65 "Geist Mono Variable",
      monospace;
  }
  select {
    font:
      13px "Geist Variable",
      sans-serif;
    min-height: 44px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  textarea {
    resize: vertical;
    min-height: 260px;
  }
  textarea:focus-visible,
  input:focus-visible,
  select:focus-visible,
  button:focus-visible,
  a:focus-visible,
  summary:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #48e5c2;
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }
  button {
    min-height: 40px;
    border: 1px solid #48e5c2;
    background: #48e5c2;
    color: #08231c;
    border-radius: 7px;
    font:
      600 12px "Geist Variable",
      sans-serif;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  button:disabled {
    opacity: 0.45;
    cursor: default;
  }
  button.sp-secondary,
  .sp-key-actions button {
    border-color: #2c2f35;
    color: #a6adb9;
    background: transparent;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .sp-input-heading {
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .sp-file-label {
    color: #48e5c2;
    font-size: 11px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  input[type="file"] {
    max-width: 180px;
    font-size: 10px;
    display: block;
  }
  .sp-note {
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #9296a0;
  }
  .sp-run-actions {
    justify-content: flex-start;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .sp-result-panel {
    padding: 22px;
    border: 1px solid #2c2f35;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #0d1014;
  }
  h4 {
    margin: 0;
    font:
      11px "Geist Mono Variable",
      monospace;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #a6adb9;
  }
  .sp-quality {
    border: 0;
    padding: 0;
    color: #ff9a88;
  }
  #sp-status {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #a6adb9;
    margin: 22px 0;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .sp-output-actions {
    justify-content: flex-start;
    margin: 22px 0;
  }
  #sp-terminal-controls label {
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .sp-key-actions {
    justify-content: flex-start;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .sp-key-actions button {
    padding: 8px 10px;
  }
  #sp-output {
    max-height: 360px;
  }
  .sp-boundary {
    border-top: 1px solid #2c2f35;
    padding-top: 18px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #9296a0;
  }
  .sp-credits {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #9296a0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  #sp-visual :global(.sp-probability) {
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  #sp-visual :global(.sp-probability-label) {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font:
      12px "Geist Mono Variable",
      monospace;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  #sp-visual :global(.sp-probability-track) {
    background: #232932;
    height: 3px;
  }
  #sp-visual :global(.sp-probability-fill) {
    background: #48e5c2;
    height: 3px;
  }
  #sp-visual :global(svg) {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 170px;
  }
  #sp-visual :global(pre) {
    white-space: pre;
    overflow-x: auto;
    min-height: 120px;
    color: #c7ded7;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .specialist-labs {
      padding: 32px 20px;
    }
    .sp-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .specialist-labs[data-has-result="true"] .sp-result-panel {
      order: -1;
    }
    .sp-tabs {
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .sp-tabs button {
      min-height: 48px;
    }
    .sp-tabs button span {
      margin-left: 4px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    textarea,
    input[type="text"] {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .sp-result-panel {
      padding: 18px;
    }
    .sp-model {
      max-width: 100%;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }
  }
  @media (hover: hover) {
    button:not(:disabled):hover {
      filter: brightness(1.08);
    }
  }
</style>
